B.adI=new A.bV("An account is optional \u2013 the app works fully without one. Signing up never turns on analytics or data sharing; those stay off until you choose.",B.FK,B.y,!1,null)
B.adJ=new A.bV("No VIN, no account, no device ID, no location, no live readings and nothing from the demo scanner.",B.ce,B.y,!1,null)
B.acf=new A.ag(984567,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.adN=new A.bV("This is a manufacturer-specific code. Its meaning depends on the make and model, so the app does not guess a description. A dealer or workshop with manufacturer software can look it up.",B.acf,B.aH,!1,null)
B.mq=new A.ag(63624,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.adO=new A.bV("Your service history is stored on this phone only. It isn\u2019t backed up or shared.",B.mq,B.y,!1,null)
B.adP=new A.bV("You can switch the lights, fan and demister off now.",B.xt,B.y,!1,null)
B.adQ=new A.bV("Connecting to your IQ\u2026",B.FM,B.y,!0,null)
B.ab3=new A.ag(58236,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.adT=new A.bV("Before connecting: park with the handbrake on, plug the IQ's OBD\u2060-\u2060II scanner into the port under your dashboard and turn the ignition on.",B.ab3,B.y,!1,null)
B.adU=new A.bV("Stored on this phone only.",B.mq,B.y,!1,null)
B.xB=new A.ag(984785,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.adV=new A.bV("Your IQ can inflate to these. Check the tyres cold \u2013 before you\u2019ve driven far.",B.xB,B.y,!1,null)
B.adW=new A.bV("Nothing is pinned.",B.ce,B.y,!1,null)
B.adY=new A.bV("Service history, reminders and tyre pressures are stored on this phone only.",B.mq,B.y,!1,null)
B.Gi=new A.bV("A voltage test is a guide, not a load test. It can spot a flat battery, a weak start or a charging problem, but only a load test at a battery or auto shop can confirm a battery\u2019s health. The scanner\u2019s reading can differ from a multimeter by a tenth of a volt or two, and it reads several times a second while starting, so the true lowest point can be a little lower than shown.",B.ce,B.y,!1,null)
B.adZ=new A.bV("Connect your IQ to run the test. It reads the battery through your car\u2019s diagnostic port.",B.xu,B.y,!1,null)
B.abn=new A.ag(62006,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.Gj=new A.bV("Reminders show in the app \u2013 on your dashboard and this vehicle\u2019s page. You won\u2019t get phone notifications.",B.abn,B.y,!1,null)
B.ae0=new A.bV("This app never clears codes. Leaving them stored helps your mechanic diagnose the fault, and clearing also resets the emissions self-tests.",B.FA,B.y,!1,null)
B.ae1=new A.bV("\u201cNot ready\u201d means the test hasn\u2019t finished yet \u2013 not that it failed. Drive as you normally would; there\u2019s no need to watch the app. Scan again once you\u2019re parked.",B.ce,B.y,!1,null)
B.abs=new A.ag(62440,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ae2=new A.bV("The sticker your workshop leaves on the windscreen usually shows the next service date and odometer.",B.abs,B.y,!1,null)
B.abP=new A.ag(63488,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ae3=new A.bV("Reading codes, readiness and the freeze frame. This takes a few seconds \u2013 keep the ignition on.",B.abP,B.y,!0,null)
B.ae4=new A.bV("A simple guide built only from readings your vehicle reports. It is not a diagnosis \u2013 always get a workshop opinion for anything that worries you.",B.ce,B.y,!1,null)
B.ae5=new A.bV("Answers come from your scan and the app\u2019s built-in knowledge, worked out on this phone. They\u2019re general information, not a diagnosis \u2013 have a qualified mechanic inspect your car before you replace parts, or if you\u2019re worried about safety.",B.mo,B.y,!1,null)
B.ae6=new A.bV("This price is from when the app was made and may have changed. Our website shows the current price before you pay.",B.ce,B.y,!1,null)
B.ae7=new A.bV("Long-press any value to copy it.",B.ce,B.y,!1,null)
B.ae8=new A.bV("When your IQ is connected and the car reports its odometer, it\u2019s updated here \u2013 after a quick check that it\u2019s this car. Not every car shares it.",B.pX,B.y,!1,null)
B.ae9=new A.bV("The demo scanner has no real VIN \u2013 type yours in from the windscreen or registration papers.",B.ce,B.y,!1,null)
B.aea=new A.bV(u._,B.ce,B.y,!1,null)
B.aeb=new A.bV("Couldn\u2019t keep this result on your phone. You can still share it.",B.km,B.aL,!0,null)
B.abv=new A.ag(62542,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aec=new A.bV("Both are off until you turn them on. You can also create an optional account later to back up your garage.",B.abv,B.y,!1,null)
B.aee=new A.bV("Your car isn\u2019t answering \u2013 the ignition may be off. That\u2019s fine: the scanner reads the battery at the port. Checks that need the car itself, like engine speed, are left out.",B.FW,B.y,!1,null)
B.aef=new A.bV("In the demo, the simulated car does this for you when you tap.",B.kj,B.y,!1,null)
